{"id":"condicio_n","lemma":"condición","pos":"noun","rank":1405,"glosses":["condition","possibility; the makings"],"ipa":"/kondiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"condiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-condici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿En qué condiciones está el edificio?","en":"What condition is the building in?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687934","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"building"}]},{"text":"Sólo pongo una condición.","en":"I only have one condition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586887","words":[null,{"g":"orangutan"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuáles son las condiciones del contrato?","en":"What are the terms of the contract?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687933","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which","l":"cuál"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"contract, agreement"}]},{"text":"Lo haré, pero con una condición.","en":"I'll do it, but there's one condition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689055","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Yo no quiero trabajar en estas condiciones.","en":"I don't want to work under these conditions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594703","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]}]}